%% Revision- and digest-bound review decisions with Codex handoff.
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Avenir Next, Segoe UI Variable, PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif","primaryColor":"#eff6ff","primaryBorderColor":"#4c91ff","primaryTextColor":"#172033","secondaryColor":"#edf4ef","tertiaryColor":"#fff3ed","lineColor":"#52627b","textColor":"#172033","actorBkg":"#ffffff","actorBorder":"#52627b","actorTextColor":"#172033","signalColor":"#52627b","signalTextColor":"#172033","noteBkgColor":"#fbfdff","noteBorderColor":"#e3eaf3","noteTextColor":"#172033","activationBkgColor":"#edf3f9","activationBorderColor":"#52627b"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Reviewer as 审批人
    participant UI as Desktop
    participant Main as Electron Main
    participant Daemon as Go Daemon / Desktop API
    participant Review as Cloud Review API
    participant Runtime as Job Runtime
    participant Codex as Codex
    participant Workspace as Local Workspace

    Daemon->>Review: desktop.review.inbox(device capability)
    Review-->>Daemon: inbox + allowed_actions
    Daemon-->>Main: typed review projection
    Main-->>UI: gate pending(subject, revision, digest)
    Reviewer->>UI: 打开精确版本、diff、来源和风险
    alt 批准
        UI->>Main: approve(revision, reason)
        Main->>Daemon: typed IPC command
        Daemon->>Review: desktop.review.approve(device, revision, digest, reason)
        Review->>Review: 再校验权限、Gate、revision
        Review-->>Runtime: gate satisfied event
        Review-->>Daemon: ApprovedSnapshot
        Daemon-->>UI: ApprovedSnapshot
    else 要求修改
        UI->>Main: request changes(comment, revision)
        Main->>Daemon: typed IPC command
        Daemon->>Review: desktop.review.request_changes(device, revision, digest, comment)
        Review-->>Daemon: changes_requested
        Daemon-->>UI: changes_requested
        Reviewer->>Codex: 对象 Handoff 请求修订
        Codex->>Workspace: Claim → Proposal → Apply
        Workspace-->>UI: new local revision
        UI->>Review: submit new cloud revision
        Review-->>UI: old review expired，new review pending
    else 驳回
        UI->>Main: reject(revision, reason)
        Main->>Daemon: typed IPC command
        Daemon->>Review: desktop.review.reject(device, revision, digest, reason)
        Review-->>Runtime: branch rejected / cancelled
    end
